  "body": "4.9ha Countryside Haven\r\n\r\nExperience the best of both worlds— lifestyle living meets urban convenience on this expansive 4.9-ha property, nestled within the Residential – Large Lot Zone under the Unitary Plan.\r\n\r\nPositioned near the highly sought-after Long Bay, with its stunning beach and regional park, this picturesque north-facing landholding offers an exceptional opportunity for astute buyers.\r\n\r\n• Prime Location: Moments from top local schools, parks, shops, and restaurants\r\n• Versatile Appeal: Ideal for land bankers, lifestyle seekers, or development visionaries\r\n• Future Growth: Positioned in a rapidly expanding area, offering strong investment potential\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to create your dream rural escape with urban convenience or explore the site's development potential, this is an opportunity you won’t want to miss.\r\n\r\nContact us today to secure your slice of Long Bay’s future!",
